<title>UK: Tate and Lyle appoints Pillard to CEO.</title>
<headline>Tate and Lyle appoints Pillard to CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tate and Lyle Plc, the UK sugar and starch producer, said on Tuesday it had appointed Larry Pillard chief executive with immediate effect.</p>
<p>Pillard was the former chief operating officer and group managing director, the group said in a statement.  </p>
<p>&quot;His expertise in developing and operating manufacturing facilities, as well as commercialisation of new products, will greatly benefit the group strategy as it develops its global businesses,&quot; chairman Sir Neil Shaw said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
